data/
.git
.gitignore
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj
app_backup.R
__pycache__/
*.hds
*.gpkg
*.parquet
*.csv

# Keep the bundled demo data in the image despite the rules above. Note: demo/
# is gitignored (not committed), but the Docker *build context* is the working
# directory, not git - so as long as demo/ exists locally when you run
# `docker build`, it is copied into the image. Generate it first with
# scripts/make_demo.py on a machine that has flopy.
!demo/
!demo/**
